  "description": "One component with a `variant` prop: 'platform' (/lms and /nova), 'enterprise' (/lms/enterprise), 'mentoring' (/lms/mentoring-software). Centred H2 + grey paragraph, then a row of equal tab buttons ABOVE a full-width loop slider whose slides hold a lead-in title + continuation copy and a 16:9 product screenshot; a centred customer quote closes the block (platform/enterprise reuse TestimonialQuote 'autotabs'/'autotabs-enterprise'; mentoring renders its own 24px quote with a small avatar row). 'platform' renders the slide title inline in white with grey copy run-on; 'enterprise' puts the title on its own line; 'mentoring' nests the slider in an extra padding wrapper and uses cover screenshots. <=767 the tab row wraps (200px tabs, 3.5rem tall); <=479 two tabs per row.",
